Anil, Rohan and Dmitry and Lepikhin and Borgeaud, Sebastian and Bachem, Olivier and Joulin, Armand and Andreev, Alek and Hardin, Cassidy and Dadashi, Robert and Hussenot, L{\'e}onard},
